# Files vendored byte-identical across the SPOKES only.
#
# The hub (CultureMech) deliberately has none of these: they are the machinery a
# spoke uses to diff itself against the hub, and a hub copy would make the hub
# check itself against itself — the self-referential pin that CultureMech
# retired in TraitMech#182. So these cannot be audited against the hub the way
# shared/idlabel/MANIFEST files are; claw's mirror is the reference instead.
#
# Same relative path in every spoke. One per line, '#' comments allowed.
scripts/check_vendored_sync.sh
